IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE2.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ED PIC Z(3)9.999.
01 WS-X20 PIC X(20).
01 WS-N5 PIC 9(5).
01 WS-S7 PIC S9(5)V99.
01 WS-ED2 PIC -(4)9.99.
01 WS-LEN PIC 9(3).
01 WS-G.
   05 WS-GA PIC X(3).
   05 WS-GB PIC 9(3).
   05 WS-GC PIC Z(2)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    DISPLAY "ED:[" WS-ED "]"
    DISPLAY "X20:[" WS-X20 "]"
    DISPLAY "N5:[" WS-N5 "]"
    DISPLAY "S7:[" WS-S7 "]"
    DISPLAY "ED2:[" WS-ED2 "]"
    DISPLAY "G:[" WS-G "]"
    MOVE "MATCH" TO WS-X20
    DISPLAY "X20:[" WS-X20 "]"
    COMPUTE WS-LEN = FUNCTION LENGTH(WS-ED)
    DISPLAY "LEN ED:" WS-LEN
    IF WS-ED = SPACES DISPLAY "ED = SPACES" ELSE DISPLAY "ED NOT SPACES" END-IF
    IF WS-X20 = "MATCH" DISPLAY "X20 = MATCH" ELSE DISPLAY "X20 NOT MATCH" END-IF
    STOP RUN.
